{"version":1,"content":"<p>FreeBSD項目近日公佈了2026年第三季度工作進展報告，涵蓋人工智能輔助開發、歐盟網絡安全法規適配、虛擬化管理工具、桌面體驗優化以及存儲和內核調度等多個方面。其中，如何規範人工智能工具在開源項目中的使用，成為本季度最受關注的議題之一。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585958.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T13:38:57.023697+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T13:24:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T13:32:15.793678+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T13:32:15.793678+00:00","content_hash":"42173ff1af83680bc6126647ebc54ad8b91ea2e3752f9c0f078c6bae7fa1bcee","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}